  "description": "The Brewmasters Guild\n\nThe group of explorers knows as the Brewmasters travel the Isle of Solaris in search of rare herbs, mystical springs and elaborate brewing techniques in order to perfect the delicate art of brewing. Stouts, ales and lagers are what fuels their search and keeps the different races who call themselves brewmasters both jolly and focused.\n\n‐-----------------------------------------",
